              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛ̈nɛ jɛ, kɛ cäŋ kɛl mëë te Je-kɔb thät cuɛɛni ti dɛɛr, cu E-thɔ luny jɔk guäth jälikɛ ɛ ca näk ɛ buɔth ɛlɔ̱ŋ. Min cɛ cuɛy tin thalkɛ ŋuäc, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cuɛ Je-kɔb lim i̱, “Jio̱mni ɣä ɛn cuɛɛni tɔ̱ luaal tɔ̱tɔ̱ kɛ ɣöö ci buɔth ɣä näk.” Cu luɔt kä mëë cɔaalkɛ ni jɛ i̱ Ɛ-dɔm",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25:30",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ɛ-dɔm",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kɛ thok Ɣi-bɛ-ru lotdɛ ni ɣöö mi dɛ̈ɛ̈r. Kuɛnɛ kä Tuk Cäkä Ɣɔaa 25:30.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " cua nɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Je-kɔb jɛ loc i̱, “Kämni ɣä gua̱a̱th di̱tädu kɛ nhiam.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Je-kɔb jiök i̱, “Ɛn täämɛ, ci thia̱k ni ɣöö bä muɔn, kä bi gua̱a̱th di̱tädä luɔtdɛ ku la ŋu kä ɣä mi wa̱a̱ li̱w.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cɛ nɔmɔ lar inɔ, cu Je-kɔb ɛ jiök i̱, “Mi ciɛ nhɔk, jɔl rɔ kɛ yac nhiamdä.” Ɛ jɛn, cuɛ rɔ cu yac nhiam Je-kɔb. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 25:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Min cɛ rɔ cu yac, cu Je-kɔb ɛ cu moc kɛ juray kɛnɛ cuɛy tin kɔɔn. Cuɛ mi̱th, kä cuɛ maath, kä cuɛ rɔ jiɛc, kä cuɛ cu wä. Cu E-thɔ gua̱a̱th di̱tädɛ cu jak kä mi thil luɔt inɔ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.25.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
